# vercel
.vercel

# environment — NEVER commit real values.
# Broad by design: any new .env variant is ignored by default rather than needing
# a rule added for it. The single negation must stay LAST, or it is overridden.
# `vercel link` appends its own `.env*` line; consolidated here so the negation
# cannot end up above it.
.env*
!.env.example

